  <Properties>
    <Name>Modern American Unique Units</Name>
    <Stability>Alpha</Stability>
    <Teaser>Updated Marines and Helicopter.</Teaser>
    <Description>American Unique Units changed to updated/upgraded Marines and Apache Helicopter. No Minuteman or B17. Marines and Helicopters removed for other players. 
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]
America renamed "Modern America"/"Modern US" leader treat is updated to +1 sigth, 50% discount on tiles and faster great people spawn.
[NEWLINE]
[NEWLINE]Updated helicopter model by Spovin.</Description>
